&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Pinterest Sales Managers and leadership to execute the agency strategy in conjunction with the sales teams’ priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with our Global Agency team to identify local market opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, negotiate and close annual commercial partnerships with assigned agency networks following central guidelines and policies in collaboration with our Commercial team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prove demonstrable impact of the agency team’s work using an effective combination of metrics and market feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually keep agencies updated with new Pinterest ad offerings so they can present new offerings to partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, analyze, and communicate key quantitative metrics and business trends as they relate to agency relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to help Pinterest build a world-class advertising platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-powered tools to monitor client and agency portfolio performance, proactively identify growth opportunities, and flag risks before they impact results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years Digital advertising agency and agency sales experience, working specifically with media agencies to deliver quarterly revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrative capabilities in implementing sales strategies into the HoldCo agency network, showing a strong understanding of agency operating models and structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with executive-level business and marketing leaders within agency organizations with a customer focus. An existing network of senior agency contacts is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of negotiating and managing commercial partnerships, ensuring accountability from internal xfn and agency stakeholders to deliver on annual goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An independent, business-focused creative thinker who is excited to work with leading agency partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, attention to detail, and a bias for proactively resolving issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-powered analytics, optimization or workflow tools in digital advertising (e.g. for forecasting, pacing, targeting, or creative testing) to drive measurable revenue or performance impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocation Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is not eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinflex/&quot;&gt; PinFlex&lt;/a&gt; page to learn more about our working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Office Requirement Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We let the type of work you do guide the collaboration style. That means we&#39;re not always working in an office, but we continue to gather for key moments of collaboration and connection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration 1-2 times per week and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from our Tokyo office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
