&lt;li&gt;We recognize that the ideal environment for work is situational and may differ across departments. What this looks like day-to-day can vary based on the needs of each organization or role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration &lt;strong&gt;2 times/month &lt;/strong&gt;and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from one of the following offices: SF or PA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
