&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead an engineering team delivering mid-funnel ad products end to end, ensuring projects are well-scoped, de-risked, and shipped on time with strong performance against target metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives to apply AI across mid-funnel ad products, using AI to accelerate prototyping, experimentation, and iteration while maintaining quality and safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI adoption in developer workflows, using AI to automate repeatable tasks (e.g., testing, documentation, code reviews) and improve engineering velocity and capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to synthesize complex inputs (metrics, experiments, user feedback, incidents) into clear insights that inform roadmap, tradeoffs, and technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the engineering owner for this workstream: define the technical roadmap, architecture, and long-term vision in partnership with cross-functional partners (PM, Design, DS, PMM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute code and lead implementation of key projects, setting a high technical bar and modeling best practices in design, testing, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a healthy, high-trust team culture, providing coaching, feedback, and career development support to engineers at different levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional stakeholders to align on priorities, manage dependencies, and communicate progress, risks, and outcomes clearly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of industry experience building complex and user-facing products, with clear accountability for timelines, quality, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience&amp;nbsp;leading or managing engineering teams, including setting direction, driving execution, and supporting team members’ growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI to improve speed and quality in your day-to-day engineering workflow (e.g., prototyping, code generation, test creation, documentation), with a clear approach to validating accuracy and robustness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of critically evaluating AI-assisted work through testing, source-checking, data validation, and peer review; you know when to trust, when to verify, and when to override.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High integrity and ownership: you protect sensitive data, avoid over-reliance on AI, and remain fully accountable for final decisions, shipped systems, and team outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on technical background in ads or similarly high-scale domains, including designing and implementing core components in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional collaboration skills with cross-functional partners, with the ability to navigate ambiguity, make tradeoffs, and keep stakeholders aligned on priorities and progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, a related technical field, or equivalent experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
