&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform and ecosystem fluency&lt;/strong&gt; across digital advertising, including social, search, app performance, and/or measurement platforms; familiarity with Pinterest Ads Manager and comparable platforms is highly desirable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-functional programs&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of mobilizing teams across Product, Engineering, Measurement, Creative, and Sales to solve open-ended client challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to influence and co-build product development&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally through direct partnership with Product and Engineering teams to represent client needs and shape platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency&lt;/strong&gt; across account strategy and sales motions to uncover insights, sharpen strategic narratives, and show up as a strong, trusted advisor while maintaining sound judgment and a high bar for quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
