&lt;li&gt;We recognize that the ideal environment for work is situational and may differ across departments. What this looks like day-to-day can vary based on the needs of each organization or role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration&lt;strong&gt; 1 day per week &lt;/strong&gt;and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from one of the following offices &lt;strong&gt;[Seattle or Bay Area]&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
