&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of US GAAP, including experience researching and applying complex accounting guidance such as ASC 842, Leases; ASC 718, Stock Compensation; ASC 350, Intangible; ASC 360, Property, Plant, and Equipment; and ASC 450, Contingencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing technical accounting memoranda and policies that clearly document accounting conclusions, supporting guidance and relevant judgments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of SEC reporting requirements, internal controls and SOX 404&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication skills, including experience explaining complex accounting topics to stakeholders with varying levels of accounting knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple priorities and collaborating across teams in a fast-paced environment with firm reporting deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI to improve the speed, quality or scalability of accounting work, with a thoughtful approach to validating outputs, protecting confidential data and maintaining ownership of final conclusions and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
