&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pinterest:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people around the world come to our platform to find creative ideas, dream about new possibilities and plan for memories that will last a lifetime. At Pinterest, we’re on a mission to bring everyone the inspiration to create a life they love, and that starts with the people behind the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover a career where you ignite innovation for millions, transform passion into growth opportunities, celebrate each other’s unique experiences and embrace the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-life/pinflex/&quot;&gt;flexibility&lt;/a&gt; to do your best work. Creating a career you love? It’s Possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pinterest, AI isn&#39;t just a feature, it&#39;s a powerful partner that augments our creativity and amplifies our impact, and we’re looking for candidates who are excited to be a part of that. To get a complete picture of your experience and abilities, we’ll explore your foundational skills and how you collaborate with AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our interview process, what matters most is that you can always explain your approach, showing us not just what you know, but how you think. You can read more about our AI interview philosophy and how we use AI in our recruiting process &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-philosophy-on-ai-in-hiring/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Measurement Lead for tvScientific will own how we quantify, communicate, and optimize the impact of our CTV and performance TV investment. You will build the measurement framework for Pinterest + tvScientific, partner closely with Sales, CS, Product, and Analytics, and turn complex data into clear narratives that drive client decisions and revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the end-to-end measurement strategy for tvScientific campaigns, including incrementality, attribution, MMM, and test-and-learn playbooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and operationalize standard reporting, experimentation frameworks, and learning agendas for priority advertisers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and CS to diagnose performance, craft insights, and package results into compelling client-ready stories and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Engineering, and Analytics to ensure Pinterest ⇄ tvScientific data quality, governance, and scalable pipelines for measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create repeatable templates - dashboards, one-pagers, and QBR materials - that make measurement easy to use for customer-facing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify measurement gaps and new opportunities, including new lift methodologies, vertical benchmarks, and creative/landing page insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-powered tools and workflows to accelerate insight generation, automate measurement reporting, and surface patterns across large datasets at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the internal SME for tvScientific measurement: educate GTM teams, support strategic pitches, and represent the program in cross-functional forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in marketing science, media analytics, or performance measurement at a platform, DSP, TV/CTV partner, or analytics consultancy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on experience with incrementality testing, attribution, and performance diagnostics for digital and/or CTV campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL/Excel skills and familiarity with BI and visualization tools; able to QA and interpret complex datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storyteller who can translate noisy, technical results into simple narratives and actionable client recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record working cross-functionally with Sales, Product, and Engineering to launch and scale measurement programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in under-resourced, 0→1 environments with a bias to action and the ability to independently prioritize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field such as Business or Marketing, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with performance CTV platforms is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in retail/e-commerce or other DR-heavy verticals is ideal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with privacy, data access groups, and governance for partner measurement integrations is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
