&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position &lt;strong&gt;is not &lt;/strong&gt;eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinflex/&quot;&gt;PinFlex&lt;/a&gt; page to learn more about our working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
