&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record driving large-scale technical impact: &lt;/strong&gt;experience leading reliability and scalability improvements, cost efficiency initiatives, and modernization efforts across critical production systems; able to define technical strategy, influence architecture decisions, and drive execution through cross-functional collaboration, strong communication, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
