&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring exceptional attention to detail, a love of experimentation and a high bar for visual craft. At Pinterest, AI isn’t just a feature—it’s a powerful partner that augments our creativity and amplifies our impact. We’re looking for candidates who are excited to explore how AI can strengthen their work while applying sound judgment and ownership to the final outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
