&lt;li&gt;Create clear, cohesive journeys spanning notification permissions, delivery, entry points, preferences and settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous product problems into clear design requirements, user flows and interaction patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product managers, engineers, researchers and data scientists to identify opportunities, design experiments and improve engagement outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative and quantitative insights to refine visual hierarchy, messaging, micro-interactions and the timing of notification experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-fidelity designs, prototypes and detailed specifications that build on and extend the Pinterest design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly communicate design decisions, tradeoffs and recommendations, advocating for user-centered solutions that support product and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-enabled workflows to accelerate exploration, prototyping and synthesis while validating quality, accessibility and Pinner impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share progress early, address blockers proactively and contribute to a respectful, collaborative working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
