&lt;li&gt;2+ years of product design experience, ideally in growth, engagement or consumer-facing mobile products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that demonstrates strong product and visual design craft, including end-to-end flows for mobile and web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, shipping and iterating on consumer product experiences in close partnership with product management and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of UX principles and the ability to translate business goals into testable hypotheses and experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-informed approach, with experience using research, experimentation and product metrics to improve designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to scope and drive projects in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
