&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration 1-2 times per week&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
