&lt;p&gt;Millions of people around the world come to our platform to find creative ideas, dream about new possibilities and plan for memories that will last a lifetime. At Pinterest, we’re on a mission to bring everyone the inspiration to create a life they love, and that starts with the people behind the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover a career where you ignite innovation for millions, transform passion into growth opportunities, celebrate each other’s unique experiences and embrace the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-life/pinflex/&quot;&gt;flexibility&lt;/a&gt; to do your best work. Creating a career you love? It’s Possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pinterest, AI isn&#39;t just a feature, it&#39;s a powerful partner that augments our creativity and amplifies our impact, and we’re looking for candidates who are excited to be a part of that. To get a complete picture of your experience and abilities, we’ll explore your foundational skills and how you collaborate with AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our interview process, what matters most is that you can always explain your approach, showing us not just what you know, but how you think. You can read more about our AI interview philosophy and how we use AI in our recruiting process &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-philosophy-on-ai-in-hiring/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pinterest is seeking a Senior Manager, Measurement Solutions to lead our APAC Measurement organization from Singapore.&lt;br&gt;This leader will shape how Pinterest demonstrates commercial value to advertisers across APAC, partnering closely with Sales, Product, Engineering, Privacy, agencies, and external measurement partners. The role will lead a distributed team and operating model across Singapore/GCR, Australia, Japan, and other growth markets.&lt;br&gt;The right candidate combines deep measurement expertise with commercial judgement, executive presence, and a track record of building durable teams and systems across complex markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and execute the APAC Measurement Solutions strategy across lower-funnel measurement, experimentation, MMM, clean rooms, retail media, and measurement best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with APAC Sales leadership to translate market and advertiser priorities into clear measurement plays, account plans, and escalation paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a high-performing regional Measurement team, including senior ICs and market leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable operating mechanisms for prioritization, capacity planning, inspection, and cross-market knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance privacy-safe data collaboration and measurement partnerships with agencies, retailers, data partners, and priority advertisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent APAC in global Measurement, Product, Engineering, and commercial forums; bring APAC insights and reusable plays to the broader organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen regional thought leadership and create clear narratives that help sellers, clients, and leaders understand Pinterest’s measurement value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in Measurement, Marketing Science, Ads Science, Analytics, Commercial Strategy, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams and influencing executive stakeholders across multiple APAC markets or similarly complex international environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in lower-funnel measurement, experimentation, incrementally, MMM, attribution, and/or privacy-safe measurement solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across Sales, Product, Engineering, Legal/Privacy, agencies, and external data or measurement partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build talent, establish accountability, and create scalable operating systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to simplify complex technical and commercial topics for senior audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgement, an inclusive leadership style, and a solution-oriented approach to ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use AI thoughtfully to improve analytical or operational effectiveness while maintaining validation, integrity, and ownership of final outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field or equivalent relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data clean rooms, retail media networks, identity/data partners, or first-party data collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Singapore/GCR, Japan, Australia, or broader APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with agency ecosystems and enterprise advertisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in commerce, retail, CPG, performance advertising, or platform measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocation Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is not eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinflex/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;PinFlex&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;page to learn more about our working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
