&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Provide partners with the tools, training, and resources needed to effectively position Pinterest’s value proposition and full product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Drive scalable enablement and education programs through partners to increase product adoption and advertiser success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Represent Pinterest at industry events, trade shows, and conferences to build relationships with prospective partners and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal technical and non-technical teams (e.g., marketing, product, legal, finance, sales operations, policy) to ensure smooth execution of sales programs and partner deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Drive growth with AI insights by leveraging AI-powered analytics to identify strategic opportunities, forecast trends, and guide partners toward data-backed growth strategies on Pinterest.&lt;/li&gt;
