&lt;li&gt;Design, launch, and analyze experiments to optimize ad campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reporting and analytics tools for the Data Science Team&#39;s customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate insights from reporting tools into tvScientific&#39;s Data Science Product.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
