&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is not eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our &lt;a class=&quot;text-blue-500&quot; href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinflex&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;PinFlex page&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more about our flexible work model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Office Requirement Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We prioritize flexibility, but believe in the power of in-person connection. This role requires occasional onsite collaboration (1-2 times per quarter), so you can be located anywhere in Ontario.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
