&lt;p&gt;Through our interview process, what matters most is that you can always explain your approach, showing us not just what you know, but how you think. You can read more about our AI interview philosophy and how we use AI in our recruiting process &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-philosophy-on-ai-in-hiring/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking an experienced and motivated individual to join our team as a Sr. Sourcer in APAC. In this role, you will play a pivotal role in sourcing candidates to help and scale our APAC team. The ideal candidate will have experience and expertise in sourcing, strategizing complex searches, building meaningful relationships with recruiting team peers and key stakeholders, and helping hire stellar candidates into Pinterest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive sourcing for multiple domains within our APAC hiring region, leveraging innovative sourcing strategies to attract top talent and ensure hiring goals are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute comprehensive sourcing plans, including talent pooling, market mapping, and competitor analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with hiring managers, key stakeholders (e.g., HR, Compensation, etc) to align recruiting strategies with organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pipeline activity, maintain data integrity, and provide data-driven updates to stakeholders to inform decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At Pinterest our Recruiters and Sourcers use AI to build and refine their sourcing strategies. You’ll be expected to use AI to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate hiring manager needs into clear, actionable search strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the talent landscape and map companies, teams, talent clusters, and candidate movement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft compelling, personalized, and relevant outreach that improves response rates - while keeping communications human, inclusive, and role-relevant.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years sourcing for tough to fill roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of engaging passive candidates, building diverse pipelines, and providing inclusive candidate experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven mindset and approach to diagnose issues, prioritize work, and communicate tradeoffs, risks, and insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fluid environment while staying flexible, and organized along the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, evolving environment while staying highly organized and accountable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick to ramp on new recruiting tools and workflows (e.g., ATS, LinkedIn Recruiter, sourcing platforms, and scheduling tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to use AI as a partner and not a decision maker. Clear understanding of how to use AI responsibly with privacy, inclusion, and candidate experience in mind.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both Business Mandarin and English is required for business purposes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Human Resources, a related field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
