&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;We recognize that the ideal environment for work is situational and may differ across departments. What this looks like day-to-day can vary based on the needs of each organization or role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration 1-2 times per week and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance to the following offices: San Francisco, Palo Alto or Seattle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
