&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder alignment skills.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to shepherd large cross-functional teams in a fast-paced, collaborative environment.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset, using data to guide decisions and optimize workflows.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
