&lt;li&gt;Strong systems design skills across distributed systems, event-driven architectures, and service-oriented backends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ML infrastructure concepts and ability to build systems that support ML workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI to accelerate your workflow while maintaining high standards for verification, data integrity, and ownership of final outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field such as Computer Science, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
